        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "34. In recalling from layoff, the last laid off person remaining on the layoff status in each department and craft shall be the first recalled for available work to include casual and temporary assignments. Except as provided above, all the other provisions in the application of seniority and promotion shall apply.",
            "block_bbox": [
